Package: natospeeches
Type: Package
Title: Collect Speeches by NATO Leaders, Defence and Foreign Ministers, and Chiefs of Defence
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Tamir", "Libel", email = "tamirlibelphd@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Collects speeches from official websites of the 32 NATO member
    states for four offices: head of state, minister of defence, minister of
    foreign affairs, and chief of defence. A bundled, editable registry maps
    each country and office to its speech listing. The crawler respects
    robots.txt, throttles requests per host, filters speeches by keyword in
    28 languages, extracts title, date and text from HTML or PDF, and stores
    results incrementally so repeated runs fetch only new speeches.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    digest,
    httr,
    jsonlite,
    stats,
    utils,
    xml2
Suggests:
    graphics,
    grDevices,
    chromote,
    pdftools,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
